; Boss16_Kangaroo_XAU_smoke.set - ORDER-072 smoke baseline (compiled defaults,
; written out explicitly for the record). FLAT lot law (LadderMult=1.0).
; Run: XAUUSD H1 2023.01.01-2026.07.01 Model 1 deposit 10000 leverage 1:2000,
; lane "D:\Meta 5b" (portable). BUY instance; SELL instance = _16_Direction=2
; (+ its own _0_Magic when co-deployed live/demo).
; Comparison row (original Gold_Kangaroo flat, MT4 Model 1, bidirectional):
; PF 5.71 / DD 11.53% / 6166 trades. Raw comparison only - do NOT tune to hit it.
